{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45533","headline":"牧童 · 隐峦","name":"牧童","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牧童见人俱不识，尽着芒鞋戴篛笠。\n朝阳未出衆山晴，露滴蓑衣犹半湿。\n二月三月时，平原草初绿。\n三个五个骑羸牛，前村後村来放牧。\n笛声才一举，衆稚齐歌舞。\n看看白日向西斜，各自骑牛又归去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"隐峦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}